            <note corresp="#d864-f3" n="3" xml:id="d864-f3-content">
                <p>Another version of this working paper substitutes “may otherwise direct” for the
                    last three words of this paragraph.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d864-f4" n="4" xml:id="d864-f4-content">
                <p>Another version of this working paper indicates that only the last sentence of
                    paragraph 14 (<hi rendition="#italic">d</hi>) is affected by this
                    recommendation.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
